-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Birdcage Kit</li><li>Disguise Kit</li><li>Duplicate Sprites</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Disguise%20Kit\">Dwarf Disguise Kit</a></li><li>Globe Kit</li><li>Gnomish Crystal Package</li><li>Mysterious Package (AVIN)</li><li>Mysterious Package (CGB)</li><li>Mysterious Package (TBI)</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Quest%20Items\">Quest Items</a></li><li>Table Lamp Kit</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Used%20Globe%20Kit\">Used Globe Kit</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["secret-service-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"secret-service-quest","quest":"Secret Service Quest","step":"6-0","n":30,"title":"Pedir a missão e o disfarce","kind":"mention","coords":[{"x":32348,"y":32184,"z":6,"label":"Chester Kahs"}]}]}}